<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed. [CORRECTED 17:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed. [CORRECTED 17:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Oct 10-16:</p>
<p>(Corrects prices throughout)</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 100.64</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$  90.94</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  57.91</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  88.56</p>
<p>Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
